    "html": "<section class=\"lens-view lens-dispatch-view\"><h3>similar-locations-validate · 3×1×1 workgroups × 64×1×1 lanes = 192 invocations</h3><svg class=\"lens-workgroups\" viewBox=\"0 0 640 24\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Workgroups\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-similar-locations-kernel-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><rect x=\"1\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#181818\" stroke-width=\"3\" data-state=\"selection\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"0\"></rect><rect x=\"21\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"1\"></rect><rect x=\"41\" y=\"1\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1\" data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"workgroup\" data-key=\"2\"></rect></svg><h4>Workgroup 0 (default)</h4><svg class=\"lens-lanes\" viewBox=\"0 0 1280 64\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Lanes in expanded workgroup\"><defs><pattern id=\"lens-gpu-spatial-analysis-similar-locations-kernel-lanes-hatched\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\" width=\"6\" height=\"6\" patternTransform=\"rotate(45)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"6\" stroke=\"#595959\" stroke-width=\"1\"></line></pattern></defs><image width=\"1280\" height=\"64\" preserveAspectRatio=\"none\" image-rendering=\"pixelated\" data-provenance=\"metadata\" data-raster-width=\"32\" data-raster-height=\"2\" data-sampling=\"nearest\" href=\"data:image/png;base64,iVBORw0KGgoAAAANSUhEUgAAACAAAAACCAMAAAAOwC77AAAAA1BMVEVfZnJNNohmAAAATUlEQVR4AQFCAL3/AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAEIAAb1u9mUAAAAASUVORK5CYII=\"></image><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"0\"><text x=\"5\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">0</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"1\"><text x=\"45\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">1</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"2\"><text x=\"85\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">2</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"3\"><text x=\"125\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">3</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"4\"><text x=\"165\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">4</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"5\"><text x=\"205\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">5</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"6\"><text x=\"245\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">6</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"7\"><text x=\"285\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">7</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"8\"><text x=\"325\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">8</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"9\"><text x=\"365\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">9</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"10\"><text x=\"405\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">10</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"11\"><text x=\"445\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">11</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"12\"><text x=\"485\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">12</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"13\"><text x=\"525\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">13</text></g><g data-action=\"pick\" data-axis=\"lane\" data-key=\"14\"><text x=\"565\" y=\"21\" fill=\"currentColor\" data-provenance=\"metadata\">14</text></g></svg><p>64 lanes; first 15 and pinned lane labelled. Grey cells are idle or unavailable.</p><p>id probe not recorded; lane ids are computed from the dispatch shape · apple</p><figure class=\"lens-kernel-source\"><pre><code data-language=\"wgsl\"><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"1\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"2\">override INVOCATION_COUNT: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"3\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"4\">override WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y: u32;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"5\">const attributesOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"6\">@group(0) @binding(0) var&lt;storage, read&gt; attributes: array&lt;f32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"7\">const validityOffset: u32 = 0u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--binding\" data-line=\"8\">@group(0) @binding(1) var&lt;storage, read_write&gt; validity: array&lt;u32&gt;;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"9\">const ROW_COUNT: u32 = 136u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"10\">const ATTRIBUTE_COUNT: u32 = 5u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"11\">const MAX_RESULTS: u32 = 32u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"12\">const NO_RANK: u32 = 0xffffffffu;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"13\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"14\">fn isFiniteValue(value: f32) -&gt; bool { return (bitcast&lt;u32&gt;(value) &amp; 0x7f800000u) != 0x7f800000u; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"15\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"16\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"17\">// WGSL rejects NaN constants, so build one from a runtime bit pattern.\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"18\">fn getNaN() -&gt; f32 {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"19\">  var bits = 0x7fc00000u;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"20\">  return bitcast&lt;f32&gt;(bits);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"21\">}\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"22\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"23\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"24\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"25\">\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--workgroup-size\" data-line=\"26\">@compute @workgroup_size(64)\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line lens-source-line--entry-point\" data-line=\"27\">fn main(\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"28\">  @builtin(local_invocation_index) localInvocationIndex: u32,\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"29\">  @builtin(workgroup_id) workgroupId: vec3&lt;u32&gt;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"30\">) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"31\">  _ = &amp;attributes;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"32\">  _ = &amp;validity;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"33\">  _ = INVOCATION_COUNT;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"34\">  let workgroupIndex =\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"35\">    (workgroupId.z * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_Y + workgroupId.y) * WGSL_KERNEL_DISPATCH_X +\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"36\">    workgroupId.x;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"37\">  if (workgroupIndex &gt;= 67108864u) { return; }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"38\">  let index = workgroupIndex * 64u + localInvocationIndex;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"39\">  if (index &gt;= INVOCATION_COUNT) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"40\">    return;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"41\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"42\">  var isValid = true;\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"43\">  \n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"44\">  for (var channel = 0u; channel &lt; ATTRIBUTE_COUNT; channel++) {\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"45\">    isValid = isValid &amp;&amp; isFiniteValue(attributes[attributesOffset + index * ATTRIBUTE_COUNT + channel]);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"46\">  }\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"47\">  validity[validityOffset + index] = select(0u, 1u, isValid);\n</span><span class=\"lens-source-line\" data-line=\"48\">}\n</span></code></pre><table><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Resource</th><th>Access</th><th>Element type</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>attributes<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"values\">values</td><td>read</td><td>f32</td></tr><tr><td>validity<span class=\"lens-provenance lens-provenance--metadata\" title=\"Static metadata, not an execution measurement.\">metadata</span></td><td data-action=\"bind\" data-axis=\"buffer\" data-key=\"similar-locations-validity\">similar-locations-validity</td><td>read_write</td><td>u32</td></tr></tbody></table><figcaption>GPUSimilarLocations/validate · main · e13f1bf4</figcaption></figure></section>",
